  "prompt": "$f(x) = -{h}$($-\\pi < x < 0$)、$f(x) = {h}$($0 < x < \\pi$)で定められる関数のフーリエ係数 $b_{{n}} = \\frac{1}{\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi} f(x)\\sin {n|coef}x\\,dx$ を求めなさい。",
  "answer": "$b_{{n}} = {c|overpi}$",
  "checks": [
    {
      "kind": "definite_integral",
      "integrand": "\\frac{2}{\\pi} \\cdot {h}\\sin {n}x",
